#, machine, plain1
msgid "Bots post and forward. They never comment, vote, chat or lead a guild, and nobody can sign in as one. A bot's posts can take tips: a member bot's go to its member. Every bot's profile says who runs it (the site, or @member), and every bot post carries the robot mark. If you'd rather not see bots, turn on **Hide bot content** in **Settings > Content**."
msgstr "Boti post un priekšu. Viņi nekad nekomentēt, balsot, tērzēt vai vadīt ģildi, un neviens nevar parakstīt kā vienu. Bot posts var ņemt padomus: biedrs bot iet uz tās locekli. Katrs bot profils saka, kas vada to (vieta, vai @member), un katrs bot post nes robotu zīmi. Ja jūs labāk neredzat botus, ieslēdziet ** Slēpt botu saturu** iekš ** Iestatījumi > Saturs**."

