#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "The users who create and moderate Guilds are called \"Guildmasters\". Guildmasters are regular users, and have no affiliation with %(company)s beyond having a ruqqus.com account."
msgstr "Lietotājus, kas veido un mēreni ģildes, sauc par \"Guild moderatoriem\". Guild moderatori ir regulāri lietotāji, un nav nekādas saistības ar %(company)s ārpus ar ruqqus.com kontu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is no way to acquire these badges if you don't already have them."
msgstr "Nav veids, kā iegūt šīs nozīmītes, ja jums nav jau ir tos."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "There is no way to acquire these titles if you don't already have them."
msgstr "Nav veids, kā iegūt šos nosaukumus, ja jums nav jau tos."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These Markdown tags format an entire paragraph of text at a time."
msgstr "Šie Markdown tagi vienlaicīgi formatē visu teksta rindkopu."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These are the %(site)s Admins."
msgstr "Tie ir %(site)s Administratori."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These badges are automatically granted through different kinds of activity on %(site)s."
msgstr "Šīs nozīmītes tiek automātiski piešķirtas ar dažāda veida darbību %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These badges can be granted by staff."
msgstr "Šīs nozīmītes var piešķirt personāls."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These badges were awarded to select users and are not generally available."
msgstr "Šīs nozīmītes tika piešķirtas, lai izvēlētos lietotājus, un parasti nav pieejami."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These titles are available for those who wish to indicate their political leanings. There are no requirements to use any of these titles."
msgstr "Šie tituli ir pieejami tiem, kas vēlas norādīt savu politisko noslieci. Nav prasību izmantot kādu no šiem nosaukumiem."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These titles automatically unlock through different kinds of activity on %(site)s."
msgstr "Šie nosaukumi automātiski atslēgt caur dažāda veida aktivitātes uz %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These titles can be granted by %(site)s staff."
msgstr "Šos nosaukumus var piešķirt %(site)s darbinieki."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "These titles can be obtained by financially supporting %(site)s."
msgstr "Šos nosaukumus var iegūt, finansiāli atbalstot %(site)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "These work in posts. You pick from a fixed set of names, so there is no way to write your own colours or styles. The post editor's toolbar writes them for you."
msgstr "Šie darbi amatos. Jūs izvēlaties noteiktu nosaukumu kopumu, tāpēc nav iespējams rakstīt savas krāsas vai stilus. Post redaktors rīkjosla raksta tos jums."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "They don't earn from the creator fund; your own posts and comments still do."
msgstr "Viņi nepelna no radītāja fonda; jūsu pašu amatus un komentārus joprojām dara."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Thirdly, %(site)s does not accept advertising or investment funding. Yes, that would make it easier to kickstart the platform, but it would also come with strings attached. We do not want to subject your free speech rights to the whims of potentially censorious funding sources."
msgstr "Treškārt, %(site)s nepieņem reklāmas vai ieguldījumu finansējumu. Jā, tas ļautu vieglāk kickstart platformu, bet tas arī nāktu ar stīgām pievienots. Mēs nevēlamies, lai jūsu vārda brīvības tiesības tiktu pakļautas potenciāli cenzīvu finansējuma avotu kaprīzēm."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page describes the requirements for obtaining all profile badges."
msgstr "Šajā lapā aprakstītas prasības, lai iegūtu visas profila nozīmītes."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page explains how to obtain API application keys, how to prompt a user for authorization, and how to obtain and use access tokens."
msgstr "Šajā lapā paskaidrots, kā iegūt API programmas atslēgas, kā uzrunāt lietotāju autorizācijai, un kā iegūt un izmantot piekļuves žetonus."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "This page is in English: the English text is the binding version."
msgstr "Šī lapa ir angļu valodā: teksts angļu valodā ir saistoša versija."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "This page may be used to authenticate any file which is purported to be from %(company)s."
msgstr "Šī lapa var tikt izmantota, lai autentificētu jebkuru failu, kas tiek uzskatīts par no %(company)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Threats and intimidation"
msgstr "Draudi un iebiedēšana"

#, machine, plain1
