msgstr "Pārbaudīt parakstu"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Validate the state token. How you do this is up to you."
msgstr "Pārbaudīt valsts marķierierīci. Tas ir atkarīgs no tevis."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Verbal rules:"
msgstr "Verbālie noteikumi:"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "View our code"
msgstr "Skatiet mūsu kodu"

