msgstr "Kad pasts saista ar video, dziesmu vai pastu citā vietnē, pasts parāda to:"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "When referring to the %(site)s social media platform, use \"%(site)s\" or \"ruqqus.com\"."
msgstr "Atsaucoties uz %(site)s sociālo mediju platformu, izmantojiet \"%(site)s\" vai \"ruqqus.com\"."

