msgid "When referring to the business which owns and operates the %(site)s platform, use \"%(company)s\"."
msgstr "Atsaucoties uz uzņēmējdarbību, kurai pieder un kura darbojas %(site)s platforma, izmantojiet \"%(company)s\"."

